==Battleground==
*8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A simple two meatshield, midrange attacker duet such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]/[[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] should clear this easily, any other [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark Cats]] like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] will prove immensely useful as well. If you have [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bomber Cat]], this stage is trivialized.

